# CryptoForge Deployment Guide

This guide walks you through deploying **CryptoForge** to production across the following free-tier stack:

- **Frontend (Marketing Landing Page)**: [Vercel](https://vercel.com) (100% Free)
- **Backend (Spring Boot 3.2 + Embedded Tomcat / JSP / REST API)**: [Render](https://render.com) (Free Tier Web Service)
- **Database (MySQL 8.0)**: [Aiven for MySQL](https://aiven.io) (Free Tier, 5GB storage, always-on) or [Railway MySQL](https://railway.app)

---

