## Verification Checklist

- [ ] `https://your-app.vercel.app` loads the interactive landing page.
- [ ] Clicking **Log In** or **Get Started** redirects to `https://<render-backend>/login` or `register`.
- [ ] Coin prices on the landing page stream live from CoinGecko / Render backend `/api/prices`.
- [ ] Logging in with `demo_user` / `Demo@1234` opens the trading portfolio dashboard.
- [ ] Admin dashboard accessible at `https://<render-backend>/admin` with `admin` / `Admin@123`.
